[size=5][b]Hotkeys[/b][/size]
[table][tr][td][b]Keys[/b][/td]
[td][b]What it does[/b][/td]
[td][b]Where it works[/b][/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]Ctrl + Left / Right[/td]
[td]Previous / next planet, ordered by distance from the sun[/td]
[td]System map[/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]Ctrl + Up / Down[/td]
[td]Next / previous moon of the current planet[/td]
[td]With a planet selected[/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]Ctrl + Click[/td]
[td]Jump directly to a body's orbit view[/td]
[td]On a body's 3D model or its quick-access nav icon[/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]Ctrl + Drag[/td]
[td]Drop the item into a body's orbit instead of onto its surface[/td]
[td]While dragging onto a body that has an orbit[/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]Tab[/td]
[td]Flip the open info window between surface and orbit[/td]
[td]While a body info window is open[/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]F4 / F5 / F6 / F7[/td]
[td]Open Search / Missions / Market / Research[/td]
[td]Anywhere; F5 and F6 open for the selected body if one is picked[/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]F11 / F12[/td]
[td]Quick save to a new file / quick load the most recent save[/td]
[td]In-game[/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]Alt + A / Alt + D[/td]
[td]Toggle mission origin / destination between surface and orbit (A/S/D: point A, swap, destination)[/td]
[td]Plan Mission window open[/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]Alt + S[/td]
[td]Swap mission origin and destination[/td]
[td]Plan Mission window open[/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]Backspace / Enter[/td]
[td]Step back / forward through Plan Mission (Enter confirms on the last step)[/td]
[td]Plan Mission window open[/td]
[/tr]
[tr][td]Up / Down, then Enter[/td]
[td]Move through a search suggestion list and pick the highlighted result[/td]
[td]Search suggestion dropdown open[/td]
[/tr]
[/table]
Every key here is configurable, see the settings file below.

[size=5][b]Configuration[/b][/size]

Settings live in [font=Consolas]BepInEx/config/marr75.solarexpanse.qolarexpanse.cfg[/font] and can also be edited live in-game if you have the Configuration Manager mod installed. The ones worth touching:

[list]
[*][b][font=Consolas]MasterEnabled[/font][/b]: the whole-mod off switch.[/*]
[*][b][font=Consolas]ModuleStackEnabled[/font][/b]: turn off if you prefer one row per module.[/*]
[*][b][font=Consolas]ShipTilesEnabled[/font][/b]: turn off if you prefer one full-width row per ship in a body's info window.[/*]
[*][b][font=Consolas]StopArrowKeysMovingMap[/font][/b]: turn off if it fights another camera setup.[/*]
[*][b][font=Consolas]DeferBottomBarClicksToSimpleTweaks[/font][/b] (Advanced): only turn on if you also run Simple Tweaks and its quick-access-bar Ctrl-click jumps to orbit twice; Ctrl-clicking bodies in the main view is unaffected either way.[/*]
[/list]

Everything else is a feature on/off toggle or a rebindable key, grouped by section in the file.

[size=5][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
Solar Expanse + BepInEx 5 (Mono/x64)

[size=5][b]Install[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install BepInEx 5[/*]
[*]Drop the [font=Consolas]QoLarExpanse[/font] folder into [font=Consolas]BepInEx/plugins/[/font][/*]
[/list]
